  "cli_result_text": "Submitted. Summary of what these files establish for the `SCHEMA_IMPACT.md` write-up:\n\n**Current (pre-migration) tracking mechanism**\n- `zerver/models/realm_audit_logs.py` \u2014 export state today lives on `RealmAuditLog.extra_data` (a `JSONField`), keyed by `AuditLogEventType.REALM_EXPORTED = 206`. This JSON blob holds `started_timestamp`, `failed_timestamp`, `export_path`, `deleted_timestamp` \u2014 this is the \"JSON-based tracking\" the new `RealmExport` model replaces.\n- `zerver/models/__init__.py` \u2014 central model registration; the new `RealmExport` model needs an import line added here.\n\n**Direct references (actions/views)**\n- `zerver/actions/realm_export.py` \u2014 `notify_realm_export()` and `do_delete_realm_export()`, both read/write `extra_data`.\n- `zerver/views/realm_export.py` \u2014 `export_realm`, `get_realm_exports`, `delete_realm_export`, `get_users_export_consents`; creates the `RealmAuditLog` row and reads `extra_data` fields directly.\n- `zproject/urls.py` \u2014 routes `export/realm`, `export/realm/<id>`, `export/realm/consents` to the above views.\n\n**Indirect references (the \"tentacles\")**\n- `zerver/worker/deferred_work.py` \u2014 the `realm_export` branch of `DeferredWorker.consume()` runs the actual export and repeatedly mutates `export_event.extra_data`.\n- `zerver/lib/export.py` \u2014 core export logic (`do_export_realm`, `export_realm_wrapper`, `get_realm_exports_serialized`), the last of which serializes `RealmAuditLog` rows into the API-facing export list.\n- `zerver/management/commands/export.py` \u2014 CLI export command, creates its own `RealmAuditLog(event_type=REALM_EXPORTED)` row.\n- `zerver/lib/upload/__init__.py` \u2014 `upload_export_tarball`/`delete_export_tarball`, called with the `export_path` value currently stored in `extra_data`.\n- `zerver/models/realms.py` \u2014 `EXPORT_PUBLIC`/`EXPORT_FULL_WITH_CONSENT`/`EXPORT_FULL_WITHOUT_CONSENT` constants threaded through export calls.\n\n**Test coverage needing updates**\n- `zerver/tests/test_realm_export.py` \u2014 dedicated export tests, heavily assert against `audit_log_entry.extra_data[...]`.\n- `zerver/tests/test_management_commands.py` \u2014 `TestExport` (CLI export command test).\n- `zerver/tests/test_import_export.py` \u2014 import/export round-trip tests.\n- `zerver/tests/test_events.py` \u2014 event-schema tests likely covering the `realm_export` event payload.\n\n**Not found in this checkout** \u2014 `zerver/migrations/0595_add_realmexport_table_and_backfill.py` and any `zerver/models/realm_export.py` do not exist in the indexed repo; this checkout reflects the pre-migration state, so those are new files to be authored, not confirmed against existing content.",
